    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f519167bd87a8aa9737bbc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『前往尽头的旅程』……\n呵，稍微有点耍帅过头了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f98c972c8ccd0127c6638e40e597e228e2b9212863cc83e8f6a1b754ec7dba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12da7105c92cba8b14f546a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个时候，能被您选中真是太好了。\n今后也要……一起走下去好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d88635a88477b413edf2fbc698405a588a830eaee558d5988928ab18de6f40b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1fc327a8cccb911ac911d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『前往尽头的旅程』……\n呵，稍微有点耍帅过头了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f98c972c8ccd0127c6638e40e597e228e2b9212863cc83e8f6a1b754ec7dba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f5bc70c456368dee94a2bcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个时候，能被您选中真是太好了。\n今后也要……一起走下去好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d88635a88477b413edf2fbc698405a588a830eaee558d5988928ab18de6f40b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d319dee1154fff30f06d7125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论晴天雨天直线就是直线。\n那我就不会将最速拱手相让！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53023d72c2c7e088c483b9d54b287ebe1db41cd364934f6a9f6b51055db15cf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2f8b112bacd2e0c9b6a1bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还差得远呢。\n我一定会，向着那道光的前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f06129641385761615f866e48c0bb7335766193c2a7818baa3080802494785",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4eeda6f8b47c1346b820070",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我当然会华丽地获得胜利。\\n你就先做好再度采访我的准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "824775356e43fdd38ede80300bca3af13ccfe3e83a4f68b3fb2f618898d17583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e258ead7e3a99809fe5aa224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猫咖！　蹭蹭摸摸毛茸茸！\n可爱的小猫咪Forever！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3c92ed27014b5febce7ee060f19e81738c88aece01a4a2d30e621a5bd84342",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcafba727b739fe24a1912d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧！　不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1badacdaaeae3c1e43a25c5e3d66f94b932cd644ac5b843e5cb8c4e61969b91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6b2b004e3c8e28db1cf0e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸵鸟……真是个好对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6011b1a759154045113502fc36574e1542cea1489df42acd4343de02ee77f30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14dbc05cee3530fca4aee55c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猫咖！　蹭蹭摸摸毛茸茸！\n可爱的小猫咪Forever！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3c92ed27014b5febce7ee060f19e81738c88aece01a4a2d30e621a5bd84342",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950c42b9f15d9e6a59b72837",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧！　不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1badacdaaeae3c1e43a25c5e3d66f94b932cd644ac5b843e5cb8c4e61969b91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ef2a6bd2d011201d8cb4834",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸵鸟……真是个好对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6011b1a759154045113502fc36574e1542cea1489df42acd4343de02ee77f30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600f03407eb97bccee21d4a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀呼！　吼！！\n嘿嘿嘿——！！　这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59107daa7d4eb7a9d89b8a98658052441a38d59d1116aaec0db2609f97d69217",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e019e713ee76a684694c1760",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n为了庆祝我要跳舞了。就现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef61e47100477088d695051aca4f6475c96ffc045e285ab7742da4c98e23bcba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194da064c142d28d72971dde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀呼！　吼！！\n嘿嘿嘿——！！　这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59107daa7d4eb7a9d89b8a98658052441a38d59d1116aaec0db2609f97d69217",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b65fa918ad44b982eeeb01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n为了庆祝我要跳舞了。就现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef61e47100477088d695051aca4f6475c96ffc045e285ab7742da4c98e23bcba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fcbf36b8ff8ac3b7a2585f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊～没想到会突然流鼻血……\\n不过既然都赢了，也算是有个圆满的结果吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4505e7f34e8beeb23028079328eb7fc0bbcff922f324c1dbea5b9f5ecdd7b17b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9710e4cc6e776af5a2c7031f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀。是以前群访时见过的面孔呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "112192339edae5dec368927799763d2e8e5b0a2df98ae72246310f8062a48f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d9bcb21e0fc117f61eb23e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——矿石，就是要用矿石来打磨。\n只要一起度过时光，自然就会变得更加锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7a7a0867d9403b0b0fd3b0fa569445287d77ab004ca5a0a03ca3b0002c744f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017266cc359e5748a748ce03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f5990fe4df87ca03663f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4720f96d07a1d969fae07d81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c54fd233f1263c06d12fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d3b7ac0d548fe1a79214b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64754ab9a65e35ec957f6817",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d673ba2e5d33fa4d1b8e1cc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "事到如今，不必多言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ed9dd0c780ba61e35c4249be3216ac8181fb2058e6e6f1f0c8cad325546d7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37eb3d3f84f4a47c2f425a82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……真是可爱呢。\n请您，今后也继续期待吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c52c7509661721fd57ae1579fbc9598765b5fbc2476a815828f9354e43c2b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdaf841bb12f897b1673e6a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "普通地练习，普通地思考作战，普通地尽全力\\n奔跑……就、就只有做些普通的事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c5f7048779deaf9c95c185336aef112e00152f6ecda0e3cafe411b02e02010",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2b9c088f25c13de2af1b4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "事到如今，不必多言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ed9dd0c780ba61e35c4249be3216ac8181fb2058e6e6f1f0c8cad325546d7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8daae825c400d651951b85a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……真是可爱呢。\n请您，今后也继续期待吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c52c7509661721fd57ae1579fbc9598765b5fbc2476a815828f9354e43c2b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6827fec561f81471165a0fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给可爱的未来，给担负着未来的孩子们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae6166fc014d2e0cd5dd2639484cffc004be212fa3c002494aee671795e3531",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661e97fd9a55c589dac407c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，我最喜欢吃鳗鱼了。妈妈会带我去\n好吃的鳗鱼饭餐厅哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d8cbee92432b3e4dd2e7916f6423b7053a318f78a8f2be6ad99b45650582655",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb813cba2bd300ebd86badbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，我还在学习中呢……。首先，\n希望能让后辈们在赛事中看到我的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10329574a6a0d4d833059b4350cd2f6380f68943b06665477843cd8a639762b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49218914ad04e273a5b7f0fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。我会比以往\n更加绷紧神经，迎接决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92db0b774223792bebe2a465d06c531b4bd73b760cdbd9f416f6c6c70bfb2cd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ce2c74d35497b132475258",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢各位的声援。在决赛中，\n我发誓会为大家献上至高无上的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2fb09956f6a12adb2715d1cc07db7d4068e2d232eb20912fadc4b9388c3f79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd260e20b9cacac8a79228b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，我还在学习中呢……。首先，\n希望能让后辈们在赛事中看到我的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10329574a6a0d4d833059b4350cd2f6380f68943b06665477843cd8a639762b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e7e0a1a22f41a0742d3826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。我会比以往\n更加绷紧神经，迎接决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92db0b774223792bebe2a465d06c531b4bd73b760cdbd9f416f6c6c70bfb2cd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e56898bb42b6a18de55abc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢各位的声援。在决赛中，\n我发誓会为大家献上至高无上的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2fb09956f6a12adb2715d1cc07db7d4068e2d232eb20912fadc4b9388c3f79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a33eb21e40c80e8c507553",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "徹底した自己管理とシミュレーションを経て\\n掴んだ勝利――感動もひとしおです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0725d8d3c8157288ffe211f5a51d4bcf1f3940b0f6c170ddd107e6d49ea5d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe610375ebbed64b6070e315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，但这并不是终点。要将这场胜利中\n得到的东西带向未来——我还在路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ff8ada49eaf2510e06cf6195b04a3af44ed21c5cdf373fc0a6d8aacbc87b62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e4102bd145b39edc91ace",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与您共步的未来，充满了希望与光芒。\n今天，我又一次加深了这份确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e00986881161cd0cd24e48ec5acf16cc4cbe64b74e872b2281159e4ae56214c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa6ee28fc0ac0498c38c9c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，但这并不是终点。要将这场胜利中\n得到的东西带向未来——我还在路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ff8ada49eaf2510e06cf6195b04a3af44ed21c5cdf373fc0a6d8aacbc87b62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f246a632ca20288f02e93679",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与您共步的未来，充满了希望与光芒。\n今天，我又一次加深了这份确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e00986881161cd0cd24e48ec5acf16cc4cbe64b74e872b2281159e4ae56214c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75bb0bd892fdd9b13dd5015",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，有那么快吗！？\n……咳咳。感谢您的夸奖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aab852be93e8ad4a7cfc37b10487601747650e633cd1ac1cf443d0ad5ecdd80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb75d94281154b4b9f90337",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会去订购新的兵书。\n为了将下一次的胜利，献给我的主君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ce10df6ca9c011c9365212380927091f67e85ad624b7ad2f75b602572e19d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d5c8c28e547f1f8707ea0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有的展开都在预料之中。\n只要在最后斩断一切就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbaa4ddb268c92603f0e13186470bf3636bed7c4bd05a5efb20054f94dab1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fad35d2c89fa59e21f3b926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员阁下会微笑着迎接我——\n一想到这，力量就涌上来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b73be1c5a947f35f4599711d858bc5b86106edb5a82f0390a583e45c8eea7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1257"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6b425cc05fbe278334be9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "主君还在等我复盘呢。\n得快点过去才行……失礼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4f2ac3289c06b32519ad5854dd1ef560a1be249850207b590f85a92d417b1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f559e877d6fd47111dea83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有的展开都在预料之中。\n只要在最后斩断一切就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbaa4ddb268c92603f0e13186470bf3636bed7c4bd05a5efb20054f94dab1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1259"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a5dae2b5d14349b3ca938c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ご興味がおありで？　私のメソッドで\\nよろしければお教えいたしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c170748c9c4eec832cad8c809d38b13fb0ab7151ab071c2eb25d299e41dd070",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60abc136d335268517f86a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员阁下会微笑着迎接我——\n一想到这，力量就涌上来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b73be1c5a947f35f4599711d858bc5b86106edb5a82f0390a583e45c8eea7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
