    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6abf66556731d82ca1bf21ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一直以来，我都非常感激。每个玩偶\n我都会装饰在家里或宿舍的房间里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b3ad88646e887724fb0df16789271bfd3eeed9e479adccf26bc89e11ae73ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
